<title>USA: Univ. Alabama BOT, $6 mln won by Regions.</title>
<headline>Univ. Alabama BOT, $6 mln won by Regions.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Regions Investment Co., Inc., said it won $6 million of University of Alabama Board of Trustees, auxiliary revenue Taxable bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 6.75 percent.</p>
</text>
